  "initialFailures": [
    "Initial E status assertions specified an applier but the new self buff lacked sourceScope caster. Made ownership explicit in the authoring data; positive and nonconsuming negative cases then passed.",
    "Typecheck caught an unbranded test stun status identifier; used a valid StatusId in the fixture.",
    "Review found the inherited zero-percent incomingPct still classified the fixed shadow punch as reflection and skipped the global damage multiplier. Removed it; basic/ability hook filters already prevent counter loops. Added actual multiplier and no-reflectSuccess assertions.",
    "One decoration-generation attempt overlapped the tail of a reversible mutation run. Discarded it as evidence and regenerated after both handles had completed and the original distance guard was restored."
